→ とにかく賑やか\n→ 自然でやさしい\n\n文字、色、動きまで、全部そろった形で出てくる。\n\n使い方：\n1. 下の1行を実行\nnpx skills add https://t.co/yWbL1EkEhO --skill frontend-design\n2. 作りたいサイトを書く\n3. 雰囲気を選ぶ\n4. デザインが完成\n\n一度入れれば、あとは毎回使える。\n\n110万インストールが、答え。","username":"okapi_fukugyo","tweet_url":"https://x.com/okapi_fukugyo/status/2116337353904288234","first_link":"https://x.com/okapi_fukugyo/status/2116337353904288234/video/1","created_at":"October 31, 2026 at 10:11AM","liked_at":"2026-10-31T17:16:22.353925","source":"ifttt","private":false,"notfound":false,"react_tweet_data":{"__typename":"Tweet","favorite_count":2096,"lang":"ja","possibly_sensitive":false,"created_at":"2026-10-31T01:11:59.000Z","display_text_range":[0,171],"entities":{"media":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/LMBrZmB8pK","expanded_url":"https://x.com/okapi_fukugyo/status/2116337353904288234/video/1","indices":[172,195],"url":"https://t.co/LMBrZmB8pK"}]},"id_str":"2116337353904288234","text":"Anthropic公式が、AIの『ウェブデザイン問題』を終わらせにきた。\n\nその名は「Frontend Design」。\n\n・GitHubで18.5万スター\n・インストール数は約110万\n・誰でも使える形で、Anthropicが公開\n\nAIにウェブサイトを頼むと、毎回同じものが出てくる。\n\n→ 毎回同じような文字\n→ 紫のグラデーション\n→ https://t.co/LMBrZmB8pK","user":{"id_str":"1994397706962538496","name":"おかぴ｜@AI副業40代会社員","screen_name":"okapi_fukugyo","is_blue_verified":true,"profile_image_shape":"Circle","verified":false,"profile_image_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1994400174953889792/OWCgxv1r_normal.jpg"},"edit_control":{"edit_tweet_ids":["2116337353904288234"],"editable_until_msecs":"1793412719000","edits_remaining":"5","is_edit_eligible":true},"mediaDetails":[{"additional_media_info":{},"display_url":"pic.x.com/LMBrZmB8pK","expanded_url":"https://x.com/okapi_fukugyo/status/2116337353904288234/video/1","ext_media_availability":{"status":"Available"},"indices":[172,195],"media_url_https":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2116335109058240512/img/EXrg2kpzDqgrvuAv.jpg","original_info":{"focus_rects":[],"height":1080,"width":1920},"sizes":{"large":{"h":1080,"resize":"fit","w":1920},"medi